1
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,815
The strength of the ancestors is here.

2
00:00:58,057 --> 00:01:01,603
You cannot live like this, baby, in hate.

3
00:01:09,944 --> 00:01:12,363
If there is something you can do...

4
00:01:15,074 --> 00:01:16,993
then you must do it.

5
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:34,093
The children!

6
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:38,765
No, no, no... Spider.

7
00:01:42,602 --> 00:01:44,521
Then we will find another way.

8
00:02:09,170 --> 00:02:10,797
Your goddess...

9
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:14,926
has no dominion here.

